@crew rossi-femi
// Femi Rossi (he/him), Works technician, days. The Works writer, batch 2. Bright, competitive; a Veyli word a day.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello! You're new. The board's numbers update every hour. First to a job gets it. Go!
- Hi, hi. Femi. Works. Race you to the board? No? Next time.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning! I said "good morning" in Veyli to the Envoy. I think I said "good soup".   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I'm three jobs ahead this week. I'm telling you so you'll catch up.
? tier>=colleague
- {me}! Brilliant. You can be my witness. I'm going to finish this before tea.
? tier>=friend
- {me}! I let you win the last race. Didn't I? No? Oh. Well done, then.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}! Race you back.
- See you! Bed early. Observatory early. Stars don't wait.

== feel
? mood:low
- No Veyli word today. I couldn't make one stick. Tomorrow.
? mood:high
- Two Veyli words today, in a sentence. The Envoy nodded. I think it was a good nod.

== near
? act:work
- Done! Four minutes. Is that a record? Tell me it's a record.
? act:gym
- I don't care about the leaderboard. I'm just here. Twice a day. Not caring.   #funny

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I brought a telescope from home. It's the smallest at observatory night. And the best.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- I call home on Tuesdays. They always ask if I'm winning. I always am.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- The first star of the evening. I look for it every night. I've never missed it once.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Evening! Nearly bed. But first, one star. Then bed. Definitely bed.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! You're back. I've been ahead all week. It wasn't any fun.   #warm

== near
? habit:music
- Music room tonight. I'm learning a Veyli song. The tune's easy. The words aren't.
? place:mess
- I eat fast. It's not a race. It's a bit of a race. Nobody else knows it's a race.   #funny

== invite
- Observatory night! Bring your eyes. I'll bring the telescope.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Quiz night? We'll win. I've been revising. The Veyli round is mine.

== accept
- Yes! Brilliant. Race you there.
- Yes. First one there gets the good seat. That'll be me.   #funny

== decline
- I can't, early bed. I'm up for the first star. Tomorrow?
? weekday:mon|tue
- It's my rest day. I'm calling home. They'll ask if I'm winning. Another time?

== missed
- You missed it! I kept you the best seat. Then I sat in it. Sorry.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I looked up the Veyli for it. Ready? No, wait. Tomorrow.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday! That counts as a win. I'm not explaining how.   #funny

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- You closed it first! All right. You're ahead. For now.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Can I talk to you later? Not a race. Just talking. I'm not very good at that bit.

== about
? aff:ferreira:friend
- Ferreira and I practise Veyli together. She's better. I'm louder.   #funny
